<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Art Walk San Miguel | Galería Coahuilteca</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f7f1e8;
      --paper: #fffaf2;
      --ink: #1f1a17;
      --muted: #75695f;
      --accent: #a63222;
      --line: #ddd0c2;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    h1, h2, h3 {
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin: 0;
    }

    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }

    .topbar {
      padding: 22px 6vw;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: var(--paper);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    .brand {
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    .subbrand {
      letter-spacing: 5px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-top: 8px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: 78vh;
      padding: 8vw 6vw;
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-end;
      background:
        linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,.15), rgba(0,0,0,.72)),
        url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1585468274952-66591eb14165?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80");
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
      color: white;
    }

    .hero-content { max-width: 860px; }

    .eyebrow {
      letter-spacing: 6px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(48px, 9vw, 110px);
      line-height: .92;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: clamp(18px, 2.2vw, 26px);
      line-height: 1.4;
      max-width: 720px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 28px;
      padding: 16px 24px;
      border: 1px solid currentColor;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 13px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.1);
    }

    section {
      padding: 70px 6vw;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: clamp(38px, 6vw, 72px);
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .intro {
      max-width: 800px;
      font-size: 20px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .route-card {
      margin-top: 38px;
      background: var(--paper);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 34px;
    }

    .route-title { font-size: 42px; }

    .perspectives {
      margin-top: 22px;
      color: var(--accent);
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .venues {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 22px;
      margin-top: 35px;
    }

    .venue {
      background: var(--paper);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 24px;
      min-height: 300px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .venue-number {
      color: var(--accent);
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      font-size: 13px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .venue h3 {
      font-size: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .venue p {
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .meta {
      margin-top: 22px;
      font-size: 13px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .events {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 22px;
      margin-top: 36px;
    }

    .event {
      background: var(--paper);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 28px;
    }

    .event-category {
      color: var(--accent);
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      font-size: 12px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .event h3 {
      font-size: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .event p {
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .map {
      margin-top: 36px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--paper);
    }

    iframe {
      width: 100%;
      height: 420px;
      border: 0;
      display: block;
    }

    .footer {
      padding: 50px 6vw;
      background: var(--ink);
      color: white;
    }

    .footer p {
      color: #d6c8bb;
      max-width: 620px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .whatsapp {
      position: fixed;
      right: 22px;
      bottom: 22px;
      background: var(--accent);
      color: white;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-weight: bold;
      z-index: 20;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.22);
    }

    @media (max-width: 800px) {
      .venues, .events {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      section {
        padding: 52px 6vw;
      }

      .hero {
        min-height: 72vh;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

<header class="topbar">
  <div class="brand">Art Walk San Miguel</div>
  <div class="subbrand">Cultural Guide · Galería Coahuilteca</div>
</header>

<main>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <div class="eyebrow">Independent Art Route</div>
    <h1>3 Galleries<br>in 15 Minutes</h1>
    <p>
      A self-guided cultural walk through San Miguel de Allende:
      two neighboring galleries in the historic center, followed by an independent printmaking studio.
    </p>
    <a class="btn" href="#route">Start Art Walk →</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="route">
  <div class="eyebrow">Art Walk Near You</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">Three Perspectives of San Miguel Art</h2>

  <p class="intro">
    Begin with two neighboring galleries in the historic center:
    Galería Coahuilteca and Proyecta Galería. Explore figurative painting,
    contemporary art and local cultural programming within a few steps of each other.
    Then continue to El Pinche Grabador to discover contemporary printmaking and graphic arts.
  </p>

  <div class="route-card">
    <h3 class="route-title">Suggested Art Walk</h3>
    <p class="intro">
      This compact route connects three distinct perspectives on San Miguel de Allende's
      independent art scene in a single walk.
    </p>
    <div class="perspectives">
      Figurative Art → Contemporary Art → Printmaking
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="venues">

    <article class="venue">
      <div>
        <div class="venue-number">Stop 01 · Figurative Art</div>
        <h3>Galería Coahuilteca</h3>
        <p>
          Independent figurative art gallery featuring original painting,
          drawing, artist-led workshops and intimate cultural experiences
          in the heart of San Miguel de Allende.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="meta">Start Here · Tenerías & Codo</div>
    </article>

    <article class="venue">
      <div>
        <div class="venue-number">Stop 02 · Contemporary Art</div>
        <h3>Proyecta Galería</h3>
        <p>
          Contemporary art gallery located next to Galería Coahuilteca.
          Visitors can experience both galleries together as part of the same cultural stop.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="meta">Less than 1 minute from Stop 01</div>
    </article>

    <article class="venue">
      <div>
        <div class="venue-number">Stop 03 · Printmaking</div>
        <h3>El Pinche Grabador</h3>
        <p>
          Independent printmaking and graphic arts space. The final destination
          of the route and an opportunity to discover another side of San Miguel's artistic community.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="meta">Approx. 6 minute walk from Stop 02</div>
    </article>

  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="eyebrow">Today & This Week</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">Art events near the route</h2>
  <p class="intro">
    Add real exhibitions, openings, workshops and VIP cultural events here.
  </p>

  <div class="events">
    <article class="event">
      <div class="event-category">Workshop</div>
      <h3>Dibuja tu Parroquia</h3>
      <p>
        Artist-led drawing and painting experience at Galería Coahuilteca.
      </p>
      <div class="meta">Galería Coahuilteca · By appointment</div>
    </article>

    <article class="event">
      <div class="event-category">Exhibition</div>
      <h3>Current Exhibition</h3>
      <p>
        Add current exhibition title, date, artist and source link here.
      </p>
      <div class="meta">Source: pending</div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="eyebrow">Map</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">Art Map of San Miguel</h2>
  <p class="intro">
    Start with Galería Coahuilteca and Proyecta Galería, then walk to El Pinche Grabador.
  </p>

  <div class="map">
    <iframe
      src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=Galer%C3%ADa%20Coahuilteca%20San%20Miguel%20de%20Allende&output=embed"
      loading="lazy"
      referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade">
    </iframe>
  </div>
</section>

</main>

<footer class="footer">
  <h2>Galería Coahuilteca</h2>
  <p>
    Original painting, drawing, workshops and independent cultural experiences
    in the historic center of San Miguel de Allende.
  </p>
</footer>

<a class="whatsapp" href="https://wa.me/524152169737" target="_blank">
  WhatsApp
</a>

</body>
</html>
